{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d71eaa84162fec0fca86a25638be004bc6a5af7d52b401c6c1401e1f9057e371", "ja": "（今日は『プリティ～～～ッ→ニャンニャンッ！』の\nPV撮影日。茜の考えた演出が一部採用された）", "zh": "（今天是《Pretty～～～→喵喵！》的PV拍摄日。茜想出的演出有一部分被采用了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "ccdedc63e0bb367b4731c20cbd495380985e8b58a77202fdeb79c04c5a06c6c3", "ja": "いやー、茜ちゃん、自分の才能が怖いな～。\nPVの演出まで考えちゃうなんてさ……。", "zh": "哎呀～，小茜，茜自己的才能真是可怕呢～。\n居然连PV的演出效果都想得出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "c636620f1d7fed8154112868ebcfc8a89bc289f2e0f2eca7334ad3056af5a82e", "ja": "『リアル茜ちゃん凸！　みんなをサプライズ応援！』\n我ながらすごい案だな～。", "zh": "“现实小茜突击！给大家一个惊喜应援！”\n连我自己都觉得这是个绝妙的点子呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1003_p", "source_sha256": "86ee5f962bc679bf48ab12e5dd6b2ffc581992fd6fadde4a69759c792681b12e", "ja": "確かに、茜だからこその企画って感じだな。", "zh": "确实，感觉是只有茜才能做到的企划呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "cfaef153865835217c18ed7028361fbccf2579c555ef4287a9c5504890d4caa2", "ja": "呼ばれても行く、呼ばれなくても行く……。\nそれが茜ちゃんだからね！", "zh": "有人叫会去，没人叫也会去……\n这就是小茜嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "01d700e0e8720685d66aa183cd0928aab7183ae9ecf92aeaa28fe04d29215dbb", "ja": "でも、アイディアを思いついたのは、\n応援してくれるみんなのおかげなんだけど！", "zh": "不过，能想到这个点子，也是多亏了为我加油的大家哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b29460c4caf4a2b845f7ca683dd699fd3594b3da6849e15571fcf503856e93e1", "ja": "そうなのか？", "zh": "是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "abfec32dcbf3b7d2a7a3fffc3edd52bc43daa470cb764d2a28d2ab6e7860546d", "ja": "うん！　茜ちゃんのことを応援してくれる人達……\n茜ちゃんの家族とかから、ヒントをもらったんだ♪", "zh": "嗯！我是从那些支持小茜的人们……\n还有小茜的家人那里得到提示的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1008_p", "source_sha256": "664d633f2f869eea3230587d9dcb349249019913431c574e709dd9d3f9c9e7a5", "ja": "茜のご家族か……最初に挨拶したきりだけど、\nすごく仲が良さそうだったな。", "zh": "茜的家人吗……虽然只在第一次见面时打过招呼，但他们关系真好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "d817be8450d69c2a47b514ae16847209773e457bcca9387544f6fa817d4d86fc", "ja": "うん！　パパちゃんとママちゃんは、\nいつも茜ちゃんグッズをたくさん買ってくれるし……。", "zh": "嗯！爸爸妈妈总是会给我买好多小茜周边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "7dd2f5e3c82a6870860f49be5369b243f957ea16e0bebfdb027444e5c00b0567", "ja": "兄ちゃんは、茜ちゃんに勉強教えてくれたり。\nあっ、おやつにプリンも買ってきてくれるよ♪", "zh": "哥哥还会教小茜学习什么的。啊，还会买布丁回来给我当点心哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1011_p", "source_sha256": "26cb84c3a48957197f828dfe0480ba3d8b969620bb443248b923526fbd0d8a57", "ja": "そうか。茜はファンのみんなだけでなく、\n家族にもたくさん支えられているんだな。", "zh": "原来如此。茜不仅有粉丝们的支持，也一直受到家人的大力支持啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "d70632856018d746a1d3fc86a45459596c5bebf2e4abbbfba5bb30d6d58bce02", "ja": "あとは劇場のみんなと、ファンのみんなだよね。\n特に、ファンレターやSNSの感想はうれしいよね～。", "zh": "还有剧场的大家，以及粉丝大家呢。\n特别是粉丝来信和社交平台上的感想，真的让人好开心～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "6d6d193b24fc148d3f24af900432378a5d152190dfaae87fdf5c1a1a4db1ca06", "ja": "茜ちゃんの歌を聞いて元気になったとか、\nライブを見たら笑顔になれたとか！", "zh": "比如，听了小茜的歌后打起了精神，或者看了演唱会后露出了笑容之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "031fbed705570450fed30e219e9f0753597164521486e68eaa801fc447210300", "ja": "それを読むと、茜ちゃんも元気になっちゃうんだよね。\n正に、ウィンウィンな関係……！", "zh": "读到那些内容，小茜也会变得精神起来呢。\n简直就是双赢的关系……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1015_p", "source_sha256": "84c6d9c7e109715912e5d778e498038089423a2fe2e32a1bb58abb23783eba9d", "ja": "なるほど。だから、みんなのところへ行って、\n元気づけたいというわけか。", "zh": "原来如此。所以，你是想去大家身边，为他们打气，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "743ffa664c66f27588f900ce0677727cb896a4105605e7874de4e725fc85b3e4", "ja": "たまにね、お悩み相談のお手紙とかもらうんだけど。\n茜ちゃんは「頑張れ」って言うことしかできないから。", "zh": "偶尔也会收到一些烦恼咨询的信件呢。\n小茜也只能对他们说“加油”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "261c7e17f270dba1076d6748386560a5bdd3ee52540397bc377ac99842e4b560", "ja": "だから茜ちゃん、企画が通ってうれしかったなー。\nこれなら、直接みんなのこと応援できるしね！", "zh": "所以，小茜，这个企划能通过，我真的很开心——。这样一来，就能直接为大家加油了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1018_p", "source_sha256": "066ff4661129da162c5ba697b4e1b05d99ed15f1184f1d05095caabc07ba39da", "ja": "そうだな。\nファンのみんなも、きっと喜んでくれると思うぞ！", "zh": "是啊。我想粉丝们也一定会很高兴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "6671d4d5d4c37ceab7d400b855e83db6f4b1eeca9b183e812d382d715aa9112b", "ja": "うんうん！　{$P$}ちゃん、\nもっとほめて！　茜ちゃんのやる気を引き出して！", "zh": "嗯嗯！{$P$}，再多夸夸我嘛！把小茜的干劲激发出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1020_p", "source_sha256": "b5ce5f687de3fcabc7e4ecac8da2377acd50a04c28a876f16456a1a929fc5d82", "ja": "よし！　……と言いたいところだけど、\nそろそろ本番だ。茜、準備はいいか？", "zh": "好！……虽然很想这么说，不过差不多要正式上场了。茜，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "92063d8ed1908e82ce147436075d607285be802ffe36f12faaedb20014c88780", "ja": "もちろん！　凸した時の決めポーズまでバッチリだよ！\nそれじゃあ茜ちゃん、行ってくるね！", "zh": "当然！连凸场时的招牌姿势都准备得万无一失啦！\n那么，小茜，我出发咯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0324_1022_p", "source_sha256": "48be75896d4fdc62276bf14028a79cd9ba881c8cd59ee4e30018e8c947b3f618", "ja": "（茜の励ましがたっぷり詰まったPV……きっと、\n見ている人達を、心の底から元気にしてくれるだろう）", "zh": "（这支PV里充满了茜的鼓励……一定能让观看的人从心底打起精神来吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
